</div>
</div>
<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-stretch has-tertiary-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33%">
<h5 class="wp-block-heading is-style-bold-weight has-quaternary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2">Sign up for the newsletter</h5>
<p class="has-tiny-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Sign up to receive the 5 tactics in my Longevity Toolkit, followed by non-lame weekly emails on the latest strategies and tactics for increasing your lifespan, healthspan, and well-being (plus new podcast announcements).</p>
